$ Estructura mixta — modelo real anonimizado, solo los bloques del MODELO
$ Hormigon + acero laminado + conformado en frio + CFT + MADERA
$ PROGRAM INFORMATION
  PROGRAM  "ETABS"  VERSION "22.6.0"  

$ CONTROLS
  UNITS  "KGF"  "M"  "C"  
  TITLE2  "Estructura mixta (hormigon + acero + madera)"  
  PREFERENCE  MERGETOL 0.00254
  RLLF  METHOD "ASCE7-10"  USEDEFAULTMIN "YES"  

$ STORIES - IN SEQUENCE FROM TOP
  STORY "N+11.06m"  HEIGHT 3.96 MASTERSTORY "Yes"  
  STORY "N+7.10m"  ELEV 0 

$ GRIDS
  GRIDSYSTEM "G1"  TYPE "CARTESIAN"  BUBBLESIZE 1.25 
  GRID "G1"  LABEL "1"  DIR "X"  COORD 0 VISIBLE "Yes"  BUBBLELOC "End"  
